This repository bundles third-party material that keeps its own licence:

  * config/hyde/          HyDE theme engine and themes — HyDE-Project, MIT
  * config/hyde/themes/   wallpapers and GTK themes — respective authors
  * local/share/bin/      most scripts originate from HyDE — HyDE-Project, MIT
  * assets/wallpaper.jpg  wallpaper preview — original author unknown

The configuration written for this rice (config/hypr, config/waybar/graphite,
config/eww, config/dunst, the docs, install.sh) is MIT as above.
